            "metrics", 9L
        );
      }

      @Override
      public Map<String, Long> getWorkerFailedTasks()
      {
        return ImmutableMap.of(
                "movies", 4L,
                "games", 6L
        );
      }

      @Override
      public Map<String, Long> getWorkerSuccessfulTasks()
      {
        return ImmutableMap.of(
